      text: |
        <p>---</p>
        <p>name: tenant-isolation-review</p>
        <p>description: &gt;</p>
        <p>  Review changes that may affect tenant data</p>
        <p>  or filesystem isolation. Use for auth, storage,</p>
        <p>  workspace mapping, database queries, or</p>
        <p>  cross-tenant access paths. Do not use for</p>
        <p>  unrelated UI-only edits.</p>
        <p>---</p>
        <p></p>
        <p># Tenant Isolation Review</p>
        <p>1. Identify the tenant boundary and the</p>
        <p>   authoritative tenant ID.</p>
        <p>2. Trace all read/write paths affected.</p>
        <p>3. Run scripts/check-isolation.sh.</p>
        <p>4. Read references/isolation-invariants.md</p>
        <p>   only if a boundary changes.</p>
        <p>5. Report PASS/FAIL for each invariant with</p>
        <p>   file or test evidence.</p>
        <p>6. Do not modify production credentials or</p>
        <p>   execute production migrations.</p>
  - elementId: code-note
    elementType: text
    bounds: [64, 454, 480, 40]
    content:
      style: "$small"
      fontSize: 10.5
      lineHeight: 1.5
      text: |
        <p>注意 description 的写法：既说"<strong>什么时候用</strong>"，也说"<strong>什么时候不用</strong>"——正边界与负边界同时定义。</p>
